[{"title":"张全真大资四老堂","author":"孙觌","text":"真人东方行，携幼坐小辇。\n五星聚光炯，八龙卧偃蹇。\n张公世忠孝，七叶冠蝉冕。\n翘翘麟一角，濯濯蕙九畹。\n声名大小冯，门巷南北阮。\n埙篪自鸣和，满耳听睍睆。\n舂粟悲汉谣，然萁笑魏褊。\n讵闻华亭鹤，空忆上蔡犬。\n堂堂鼎轴老，秉道迪天显。\n宁投千金璧，不践九折坂。\n飞飞鸿雁行，恋恋桑榆暖。\n草木商山村，烟波洞庭晚。\n芝老正堪茹，橘熟行可搴。\n连床话团栾，共此一笑莞。\n当年伯仲氏，衫鬓绿婉婉。\n彩衣戏翁侧，玉立尽瑚琏。\n峥嵘六门阙，突兀今在眼。\n岁月知几何，华皓森雪巘。\n扶颠属匠石，起死待和扁。\n富贵挽不来，拄颊但手板。\n谈间锯屑霏，酒伴金荷卷。\n舞茵翔两鸾，歌板曳犹茧。\n冰壶明月吐，琪树清风满。\n起寻赤松游，仙籍标阆苑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6233,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"少逸登第还里中喜而赋诗少逸过余出示和篇次韵为贺","author":"孙觌","text":"帐底诸生拥鼻谣，诗书满腹似边韶。\n禹门击水高三级，尧殿披云焕九霄。\n骏马看花春寂寂，长檠烧烛夜寥寥。\n一飞更上金銮去，满袖香烟散早朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6234,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三衢教授陈德召宠贶新篇兼辱寄惠古史赋三小诗为谢 其一","author":"孙觌","text":"伐树已扫迹，种花今问津。\n一筇随卧起，四壁空无邻。\n有怀平生游，老手妙斲轮。\n去搴柯山秀，尽作泮水芹。\n裁诗问无恙，寄此岭头云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6235,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三衢教授陈德召宠贶新篇兼辱寄惠古史赋三小诗为谢 其二","author":"孙觌","text":"世人识真少，耳剽得惊坐。\n安知百尺楼，上有元龙卧。\n儒官为官曹，学子书吏课。\n长谣振商音，丽藻发楚些。\n独有白雪章，妙绝无人和。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6236,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三衢教授陈德召宠贶新篇兼辱寄惠古史赋三小诗为谢 其三","author":"孙觌","text":"太史命世豪，始作表传记。\n著书自一家，亦足见奇伟。\n寥寥千载向，笔削号古史。\n排斥已甚哉，不学而见诋。\n孰云争名者，区区在朝市。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6237,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题灵岩五至堂","author":"孙觌","text":"老人昔记观何处，白发苍颜只如故。\n湛然不与生灭期，始信真心有常住。\n公今忘物兼忘我，坎止留行无不可。\n桑下了无三宿恋，壁间一坐九年过。\n振履忽逐秋鸿往，浮杯又趁春潮上。\n一片孤云自在飞，不落人中去来想。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6238,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑惇老谦老寄示四赋小诗为谢","author":"孙觌","text":"三椽容膝地，一枕曲肱眠。\n手把故人画，起行梦相牵。\n明河天上落，一派堕我前。\n溶溶注银海，浩浩泻玉川。\n老眼眩欲迷，今在第几天。\n堂堂通德门，种德今百年。\n斋房九茎芝，岳井十丈莲。\n连枝挺奇秀，见此两谪仙。\n诗成粲珠玉，纸落生云烟。\n一飞看昂霄，云中雁行连。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6239,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"章席祖巢云阁","author":"孙觌","text":"翳翳林影交，小閤俯江郊。\n千崖障锦绣，万壑鸣弦匏。\n翛然一枝筇，寄此三重茅。\n久知风可御，更取云为巢。\n抱石舒翠缕，绣色才可睹。\n霏霏擘春絮，欻见白鹤舞。\n凝矑一瞬间，忽展垂天羽。\n起从潭中龙，去作山下雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6240,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题李营邱画","author":"孙觌","text":"酒胆乘酣思如涌，戏括枯笔为此弄。\n谁令堂上生枫树，自是胸中有云梦。\n前山历历粲可数，浅濑鳞鳞森欲动。\n一啸参差是故林，归心已逐孤云纵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6241,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题莫谦仲山居西楼二首 其一 山居","author":"孙觌","text":"鱼盐市井富，冠盖车马路。\n生息自相吹，晨门黕如雾。\n超然尘外躅，硉兀见砥柱。\n汤汤海横流，自有安立处。\n幻泡水上沤，空华草头露。\n一峰独苍然，岁寒但如故。\n醉搴庭下花，吟绕池边树。\n便有山中臞，来随白云屦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6242,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题莫谦仲山居西楼二首 其二 西楼","author":"孙觌","text":"曾梯倚半空，百尺卧元龙。\n偃蹇一榻上，峥嵘两争雄。\n暮卷珠帘雨，夜镇犀帷风。\n吾公安在哉，云间指青红。\n俯视大千界，一器蚋满中。\n巢蚊幸有馀，国蜗遂相攻。\n湛湛天一碧，万里磨青铜。\n不落牛背上，悠然送飞鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6243,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过枫桥寺示迁老三首 其一","author":"孙觌","text":"白首重来一梦中，青山不改旧时容。\n乌啼月落桥西寺，攲枕犹闻半夜钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6244,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过枫桥寺示迁老三首 其二","author":"孙觌","text":"三年瘴海卧炎霄，梦隔青风一水遥。\n万里归来悲故物，铜驼埋没草齐腰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6245,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过枫桥寺示迁老三首 其三","author":"孙觌","text":"翠木苍藤一两家，门依古柳抱溪斜。\n古城流水参差是，不见玄都旧日花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6246,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题虎邱剑池二首 其一","author":"孙觌","text":"猘子龂龂老更狂，潭空百尺卧干将。\n但令雷焕占牛斗，不用朱云请尚方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6247,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题虎邱剑池二首 其二","author":"孙觌","text":"神兵一跃几千年，石底乖龙抱宝眠。\n尚有玉川怀寸铁，裁诗救月泪潺湲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6248,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龟潭二首 其一","author":"孙觌","text":"真源閟仙扃，一线下佛龛。\n来从白马洞，聚作乌龟潭。\n触石细瑟瑟，循除走涵涵。\n漱齿类齧雪，湔衣真佩蓝。\n醉红洒面醒，衰白照影惭。\n延缘遂清景，拄策纵幽探。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6249,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龟潭二首 其二","author":"孙觌","text":"心空闲有味，境寂澹无营。\n石鼎胀豕腹，幽幽暗泉鸣。\n铜盘印鸟迹，漠漠微云行。\n起挽枝上红，细倾榼中清。\n提壶亦劝饮，布谷仍催耕。\n悠然独往愿，一笑惬平生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6250,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罨画溪行四首 其一","author":"孙觌","text":"老牯浮鼻水中归，綵雉应媒桑下飞。\n萝茑冥冥山四起，数家鸡犬烟树里。\n一支新绿涨晴沟，杨柳中间击小舟。\n罨画溪头乌鸟乐，呼雨唤风不能休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6251,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罨画溪行四首 其二","author":"孙觌","text":"蝶趁花飞争入坐，倚空百尺游丝堕。\n乱山衔日半船明，断云载雨前村过。\n蕨芽戴土小儿拳，渔市人归柳贯鲜。\n罨画溪头人语好，烹鱼煮蕨饷春田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6252,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罨画溪行四首 其三","author":"孙觌","text":"沙头绿暗已藏鸦，竹里犹残一两花。\n蜗庐抱柳开新国，燕语窥帘忆旧家。\n春风有信自年年，罨画溪边柳系船。\n陶情满满酒如泉，醉与长瓶藉草眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6253,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罨画溪行四首 其四","author":"孙觌","text":"翠木苍藤缭白沙，槿篱茅店野人家。\n了无狡兔营三窟，只有黄蜂趁两衙。\n树头猎猎酒旗风，罨画溪边卖酒翁。\n银瓶快泻清若空，令君一笑面生红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6254,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龟潭二首 其一","author":"孙觌","text":"稚竹缘崖瘦，苍藤翳树昏。\n野花浑少态，谷鸟自能言。\n独曳烟中策，来倾月下尊。\n乐哉无与共，幽兴在桑门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6255,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龟潭二首 其二","author":"孙觌","text":"蜗舍三间小，龟泉一勺甘。\n楞严浑不看，弥勒久同龛。\n潭影千峰倒，云梢万木参。\n岩花自无主，红雨落毵毵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6256,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题董令升待制朋溪","author":"孙觌","text":"先生溪上宅，华榜有殊称。\n已为山作主，更与溪为朋。\n高甍俯流水，坐见南山棱。\n濯发云破碎，湔衣雪崩腾。\n老蟾驾月来，潋滟一镜升。\n举棹击空明，玉壶响春冰。\n夜久群动息，一啸清风兴。\n手持修月斧，自控赤鲤乘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6257,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题莫寿朋内翰所藏东坡画枯木","author":"孙觌","text":"龙筋鹤骨老催颓，百尺脩围折巨雷。\n倦鹊飞来空百绕，踏枝不着又惊回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6258,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李茂嘉寄茶 其一","author":"孙觌","text":"蛮珍分到谪仙家，断壁残璋裹绛纱。\n拟把金钗候汤眼，不将白玉伴脂麻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6259,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李茂嘉寄茶 其二","author":"孙觌","text":"大瓢贮月泻银瓶，瑟瑟松风入坐鸣。\n拟把金钗候汤眼，睡魔先已树降旌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6260,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"园中草木二首 其一","author":"孙觌","text":"葵花卧雨金杯覆，蕉叶攲风羽扇低。\n若信空华俱足幻，何妨伯厚载鸡栖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6261,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"园中草木二首 其二","author":"孙觌","text":"翠衿独倚秋风立，绛帻犹含宿雨偏。\n已见异鸡无应者，若为矫首尚昂然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6262,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题德清县舍松筠堂菊","author":"孙觌","text":"篱脚金花玉露团，枕丛寒蝶冷相看。\n不随桃李供春事，且伴松筠到岁寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6263,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"馀杭道中观何人家竹","author":"孙觌","text":"平生不省问寒温，见竹欣然便扣门。\n我是此君风月主，不应便与俗人言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6264,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送雪峰化主","author":"孙觌","text":"行尽千山与万山，青鞋布袜水云间。\n龙天正绕毗那室，乞取凋胡一钵还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6265,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山长老寄茶","author":"孙觌","text":"睡魔迎我入华胥，梦境倏然一蝶如。\n不用分灯遣将去，山翁茗盌为驱除。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6266,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴江教院首坐索诗赋一首","author":"孙觌","text":"石火光中客此身，只钻故纸敝精神。\n如今衰老浑无用，犹有虚名语世人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6267,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧慧卓","author":"孙觌","text":"瓦盂锡杖布行缠，风意泠泠意欲仙。\n一片闲云无倚著，悠然吹堕野人边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6268,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送可圭化主","author":"孙觌","text":"龙天万德拥天堂，中有维摩六尺床。\n但遣文殊来问疾，毗耶一钵满城香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6269,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"复阇黎寄示龙兴举老唱酬书一偈还之","author":"孙觌","text":"无台无镜亦无尘，云何去现句文身。\n只有华严八千偈，酬对毗那彼上人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6270,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题删定侄画卷次其韵","author":"孙觌","text":"青尖簇簇两春山，翠垒峨峨十二鬟。\n彷佛阳台梦中见，试凭画手驻君颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6271,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"修上人以楞严圆觉二经见寄书六言一偈","author":"孙觌","text":"月标指上自见，珠系衣中可寻。\n卷去与人遮眼，却来问佛徵心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6272,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑惇老谦老出示三赋","author":"孙觌","text":"妙绝窥三赋，雄才想二豪。\n望惊河伯叹，却走季咸逃。\n句挟青邱大，吟翻白雪高。\n定知空骥北，犹待九方皋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6273,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题隆上人墨梅花","author":"孙觌","text":"一枝插向钗头见，千树开时雪里看。\n惭愧道人三昧手，尽将春色寄豪端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6274,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送五侄归南安","author":"孙觌","text":"绿发青衫美少年，追风一抹紫鸾鞭。\n十年竹马儿童旧，洗眼来看立道边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6275,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题因阇黎静节轩二首 其一","author":"孙觌","text":"露叶纤纤剪绿琼，三椽潇洒竹间亭。\n青莲池上狻猊坐，碧玉壶中翡翠屏。\n晓幌日移光破碎，夜窗风过响珑玲。\n何人暂脱红尘履，一枕昏昏醉鼾醒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6276,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题因阇黎静节轩二首 其二","author":"孙觌","text":"苍云十亩护禅扃，中有金仙不死庭。\n邂逅种桃规作伴，萧条对鹤两忘形。\n空华闪闪风中絮，浪蕊悠悠水上萍。\n珍重此君真石友，岁寒不改自青青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6277,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龟潭三首 其一","author":"孙觌","text":"埋没榛芜不记年，穿云络石自溅溅。\n柳州莫作愚溪对，乞与佳名到处传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6278,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龟潭三首 其二","author":"孙觌","text":"莳竹流泉占一邱，倚筇尽日看游鯈。\n崎岖好事无人共，独饮泉旁自献酬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6279,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龟潭三首 其三","author":"孙觌","text":"山空水净竹娟娟，玉砾金沙自炯然。\n宿鹭惊窥潭底日，潜鱼翻动水中天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6280,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春事三首 其一","author":"孙觌","text":"茆栋依林出，松扉傍水斜。\n浮苍围百叠，乱绿翳三叉。\n屋破蜗书壁，庭芜鹤印沙。\n小桃供一笑，已著两三花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6281,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春事三首 其二","author":"孙觌","text":"闲随白云行，倦倚青松立。\n嚼叶须鬣香，藉草衣巾湿。\n风从月下生，月向杯中吸。\n戴星莫匆匆，秉烛要汲汲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6282,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春事三首 其三","author":"孙觌","text":"黄鹂遗好音，碧草萦别恨。\n雨擢翠千寻，风敛红一寸。\n持醪散百忧，琢句破孤闷。\n呼童数击鲜，无久诸郎溷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6283,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龟潭守冢僧伐去大芭蕉种二松其上赋小诗记之二首 其一","author":"孙觌","text":"粲粲丰肌犹外好，便便大腹已中空。\n故衣狼藉三秋雨，破扇飘摇一夜风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6284,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龟潭守冢僧伐去大芭蕉种二松其上赋小诗记之二首 其二","author":"孙觌","text":"草亡木卒太匆匆，独有髯龙在眼中。\n雨折风吹终不死，霜根雪节贯青铜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6285,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游金沙寺寺有陆希声侍郎读书堂在颐山上二首 其一","author":"孙觌","text":"一龛明灭佛前灯，破裓犹残一两僧。\n说似鸿盘读书处，试寻幽伴拄乌藤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6286,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游金沙寺寺有陆希声侍郎读书堂在颐山上二首 其二","author":"孙觌","text":"绿笋遗苞半出篱，清溪一曲翠相迷。\n古苔称意坏墙满，好鸟尽情深树啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6287,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金沙寺端老营大藏殿小诗示之","author":"孙觌","text":"平生不读一行经，解说如来最上乘。\n但绕禅床行一匝，免教钻纸似痴蝇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6288,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日二首 其一","author":"孙觌","text":"豆熟连村雨叶黄，粳肥蘸水露华香。\n凉蝉已抱寒茎槁，冻蝶犹穿晚菊忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6289,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日二首 其二","author":"孙觌","text":"云巘曾棱路远苍，井梧萧瑟陨疏黄。\n浪浪一枕芭蕉雨，端为幽人滴夜长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6290,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁暮郊行","author":"孙觌","text":"残雪溶溶水披冻，山空翠湿衣巾重。\n东家西家酒初熟，南枝北枝春欲动。\n班坐偶随鸥鹭集，意行适与牛羊共。\n直将万事付狙公，莫浪欢喜蹋破瓮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6291,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"臞庵浮天阁","author":"孙觌","text":"黄芦吹雪满汀洲，万里烟波接素秋。\n数点征帆天上落，一轮斜日水中流。\n长桥蹋月随君伴，小阁浮天赋远游。\n便买一舟为泛宅，此生何必老菟裘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6292,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"向伯恭侍郎致政芗林筑一堂名之曰企疏晋陵孙某闻而赋诗二首 其一","author":"孙觌","text":"铜臭应作幺，梦尸当得官。\n喁喁鱼聚沫，戢戢蚋集酸。\n高人有远抱，一笑视鼠肝。\n水将洗耳用，山作拄颊看。\n种芳茹秋菊，搴秀纫春兰。\n披披芰荷衣，采采苜蓿盘。\n三径偭真境，一瓢非世欢。\n富贵挽不来，为我歌考槃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6293,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"向伯恭侍郎致政芗林筑一堂名之曰企疏晋陵孙某闻而赋诗二首 其二","author":"孙觌","text":"且学方回痴，莫羡董公健。\n谁令躯七尺，浪作青紫楦。\n更摇乞怜尾，仍出吊丧面。\n芗林有老仙，蚤具佛眼见。\n国恩倘粗酬，已债遂焚券。\n驱除竹马弃，狼藉刍狗践。\n寥寥汉二傅，千岁一关楗。\n竟日饮无何，更补离骚传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6294,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再至龟潭","author":"孙觌","text":"岁岁来寻罨画春，看山弄水意长新。\n不知流水今何处，只有青山是故人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6295,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖洑上冢系舟丁山田舍小憩","author":"孙觌","text":"清溪三百曲，一片春风绿。\n茅屋有人家，窈窕闭深竹。\n老去耽田里，寓目快亲瞩。\n风漪卷翠绡，云巘镂苍玉。\n寻盟唤白鸥，解佩赎黄犊。\n独啸无一人，传声满空谷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6296,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟次蜀山遇大风雨","author":"孙觌","text":"阿香推雷车，蹑云捕黄蛇。\n打头风似箭，注面雨如麻。\n篙师不改色，移舟并苍霞。\n结缆系桑本，小定起复挐。\n畏途失九折，迷津悟三叉。\n谁知一笑中，平地有褒斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6297,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读史","author":"孙觌","text":"莫羡马革裹，犹堪柳车囚。\n谁令骨作鲠，且慕舌为柔。\n自笑丹心折，人言老语偷。\n直将轮覆井，仍取带维舟。\n唾面我勿拭，溺灰汝何尤。\n君看箦中尸，起断魏齐头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":6298,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]